// Title: Suspicious Execution Location Of Wermgr.EXE
// ID: 5394fcc7-aeb2-43b5-9a09-cac9fc5edcd5
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2022-10-14
// Tags: attack.execution
// Description: Detects suspicious Windows Error Reporting manager (wermgr.exe) execution location.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((where(Image IENDSWITH "\\wermgr.exe")) AND NOT (((where(Image ISTARTSWITH "C:\\Windows\\System32\\") OR where(Image ISTARTSWITH "C:\\Windows\\SysWOW64\\") OR where(Image ISTARTSWITH "C:\\Windows\\WinSxS\\")))))
